        "name": "Arcanopulse",
        "description": "Fires a long-range beam of energy, dealing magic damage to all targets hit.",
        "tooltip": "<span>Begin Charging:</span> Xerath begins charging an arcane beam, <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowing</span> himself gradually up to 50%. <br /><br /><span>Release:</span> Xerath fires the beam, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(70/110/150/190/230 + (90% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>. The range increases with time charged.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">If Xerath does not release the beam, half the cost is refunded.</span>",
